  "href": "extensive_game/extensive_game_information_set.html",
  "body_html": "<h1>Information Set</h1>\n<p>For player $i$, information is represented by a partition\n$$\n  \\{P^i_k\\}_{k\\in K_i}\n$$\nof player $i$'s decision nodes. A part $P^i_k$ is an information set. Nodes in the\nsame information set cannot be distinguished by player $i$ and must have the same\navailable physical actions.</p>",
